{"id":54303,"date":"2026-07-22T07:09:51","date_gmt":"2026-07-22T06:09:51","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=54303"},"modified":"2026-09-27T13:20:36","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T12:20:36","slug":"corrida-para-todos","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-para-todos\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida para Todos 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida para Todos 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida para Todos 2026<\/strong> (2\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>27 de Setembro de 2026<\/strong>, em <strong>S\u00e3o Br\u00e1s de Alportel<\/strong>, no Algarve. Organizada com grande carinho pelo <strong>Grupo de Desporto Adaptado do CMR Sul<\/strong> e pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Elo de Mudan\u00e7a<\/strong>, em parceria com o Munic\u00edpio de S\u00e3o Br\u00e1s de Alportel, a iniciativa celebra a inclus\u00e3o plena e a solidariedade atrav\u00e9s do desporto.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com epicentro nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es do <strong>Centro de Medicina de Reabilita\u00e7\u00e3o do Sul (CMR Sul)<\/strong>, o programa desportivo integra as provas de <strong>Corrida 10 km<\/strong> (novidade deste ano com duas voltas ao circuito de 5 km, com partida \u00e0s 09:15), a <strong>Corrida de 5 km<\/strong> (09:20) e uma acess\u00edvel <strong>Caminhada Inclusiva de 2 km<\/strong> (09:20) at\u00e9 ao Caf\u00e9 Manta, desenhada para atletas com e sem incapacidade de todas as idades.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento privilegia a confraterniza\u00e7\u00e3o e a supera\u00e7\u00e3o pessoal, dispondo de cronometragem para registo individual de tempos. A totalidade da receita l\u00edquida das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es reverte a 100% a favor da aquisi\u00e7\u00e3o de equipamento desportivo adaptado para os utentes e atletas do CMR Sul.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\